# Allowlist: the API image needs only webapp/ plus the dataset pin and its fetcher (the database
# itself is downloaded and verified inside the build — see webapp/Dockerfile). Keeps the build
# context small and prevents unrelated or sensitive files entering images.
*
!webapp/
!dataset.lock.json
!scripts/data/fetch_dataset.py
!tools/slice_db.py
webapp/static.bak/
webapp/tests/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
